+#     precedes the slice it just granted.  Wait for the STOP event and then
+#     call `query-budget` to read the time the guest actually reached.  The
+#     guest halts at a translation-block boundary at or after the deadline, so
+#     that value may exceed @totalbudget; a co-simulation master reconciles
+#     against it rather than assuming it received exactly what it requested.
+#
